  "recommendations": [
    "Wrap empty-risk tokens in {if ...} blocks where the surrounding sentence breaks without them (e.g. {if student.passport_number}Passport: {{student.passport_number}}{/if}).",
    "For accommodation tokens on letters issued before placement, the entire accommodation block should be conditional on accommodation.start_date.",
    "For booking-derived tokens, gate the letter UI so a draft cannot be generated without a linked booking (already enforced for LoA via assertLoaPaymentGate).",
    "Consider populating Course.fee on all imported BookingCourse rows so course_fee stops falling back silently to amountTotal.",
    "Add a \"validate template\" admin action that renders against the actual student+booking + flags every token that resolves to \"\" so staff can see gaps before sending."
  ]
}